OL,3,GNEWSADolphin given first aid after     
OL,4,Abecoming stranded on beach             
OL,6,FBDMLR said the rescuers successfully   
OL,7,Ftransferred the dolphin onto tarpaulin 
OL,8,Fand supported it back into the water.  
